# Fortune, Loyal Steed, a 2/4 Mount with Saddle 1: "When Fortune enters, scry 2." and "Whenever Fortune attacks while saddled, at
# end of combat, exile it and up to one creature that saddled it this turn, then return those cards to the battlefield under
# their owner's control." (CR 702.171b, 603.7, 400.7). On turn 1 Bot1 casts Fortune (scry 2) and a Thraben Inspector. On turn 3
# the Inspector and a Savannah Lions both saddle it (Saddle 1: tap any number of other creatures with total power 1 or more),
# Fortune attacks, and at end of combat Bot1 chooses the Lions: Fortune and the Lions come back untapped as new objects, Fortune
# scrying 2 again as it enters, while the Inspector, chosen by no one, stays tapped and Bot1 gets no second Clue.

